1
00:00:00,245 --> 00:00:02,215
(Leonard:)You're awful quiet,
everything okay?

2
00:00:02,214 --> 00:00:05,314
(Sheldon:)I'm concerned about Amy.

3
00:00:05,317 --> 00:00:07,117
(Sheldon:)She's acting a bit odd lately.

4
00:00:07,119 --> 00:00:09,389
Oh. Well, j-just
out of curiosity,

5
00:00:09,388 --> 00:00:13,028
(Howard:)what registers as odd to you?

6
00:00:16,228 --> 00:00:18,598
Her behavior.

7
00:00:18,597 --> 00:00:21,267
(Sheldon:)No, I have the feeling
that she's hiding something.

8
00:00:21,266 --> 00:00:22,766
(Leonard:)I wouldn't worry about it.

9
00:00:22,768 --> 00:00:24,768
(Leonard:)She's probably just
distracted by work.

10
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,870
(Sheldon:)Well, whatever it is,
it's troubling me.

11
00:00:26,872 --> 00:00:28,542
(Sheldon:)And I can't eat, I can't sleep.

12
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,010
(Sheldon:)And don't even ask
about the consistency

13
00:00:30,008 --> 00:00:32,008
(Sheldon:)of my bowel movements.

14
00:00:33,111 --> 00:00:36,681
(Howard:)You heard him, guys,
don't ask.

15
00:00:36,682 --> 00:00:39,212
(Sheldon:)Why would she keep
something from me, you know?

16
00:00:39,218 --> 00:00:41,718
(Sheldon:)I shared my body
with that woman.

17
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:44,890
(Sheldon:)And my Netflix password.

18
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:46,560
(Sheldon:)They recommended
Stella Got Her Groove Back

19
00:00:46,558 --> 00:00:48,888
(Sheldon:)because of her.

20
00:00:49,761 --> 00:00:51,461
(Leonard:)Buddy, buddy, listen,

21
00:00:51,463 --> 00:00:53,033
(Leonard:)nothing bad is going on,

22
00:00:53,031 --> 00:00:55,871
(Leonard:)she just... she just
didn't want you to know

23
00:00:55,868 --> 00:00:59,068
(Leonard:)that the work on her apartment
was finished a couple weeks ago.

